<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Roger Batlle Duran" .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2026-04-22" .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "Ontology for the classification and management of medical devices according to European regulations MDR (EU 2017/745) and IVDR (EU 2017/746). Enables semantic interoperability between manufacturers, regulatory authorities, hospitals and patients."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/publisher> "Universitat Oberta de Catalunya (UOC)" .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/subject> "Medical Devices, MDR, IVDR, Risk Classification, EUDAMED, FSCA"@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "European Medical Device Risk Classification Ontology (EMDCO)"@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This ontology models medical devices, manufacturers, risk classifications, incidents and corrective actions (FSCA) according to EU MDR/IVDR regulations. Supports vigilance, post-market surveillance and interoperability with EUDAMED."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EMDCO - European Medical Device Risk Classification Ontology"@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://eudamed.ec.europa.eu> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0" .
