<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresEscalation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "requires escalation"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Device> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inferred by SWRL Rule 1: device with critical risk incidents requires immediate regulatory alert."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#requiresImmediateAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "requires immediate alert"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Name of the identified risk according to IMDRF Adverse Event Terminology."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#riskName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "risk name"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Device> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unique Device Identifier - Device Identifier as required by MDR Art. 27."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#udiDI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UDI-DI"@en .
