<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#DeviceFailureRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#DeviceFailureRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk related to failure of device components (electrical, mechanical, software, battery)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#DeviceFailureRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Device Failure Risk"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ExternalDevice
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ExternalDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
