<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ExternalDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An active medical device used externally to the body (e.g., infusion pump, external defibrillator)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ExternalDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "External Active Device"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#FieldCorrection
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#FieldCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#FieldCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#CorrectiveAction> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#FieldCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Correction performed in the field without removing the device (e.g., software update, labeling change)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#FieldCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Field Correction"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#IVDDevice
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#IVDDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
