<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#IVDDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical device used for the in vitro examination of specimens according to IVDR Regulation (EU) 2017/746."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#IVDDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Vitro Diagnostic Device"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ImplantableDevice
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ActiveDevice> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical device intended to be introduced wholly or partially into the human body through surgical intervention and to remain in place after the procedure."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#ImplantableDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implantable Medical Device"@en .
# 
