<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Incident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Incident"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#MalfunctionRisk
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk of device malfunction during operation (software errors, performance degradation)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#MalfunctionRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Malfunction Risk"@en .
# 
