_:genid4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An entity that manufactures medical devices and is responsible for their design, production and marketing under MDR/IVDR regulations. Must be registered in EUDAMED with a SRN."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Manufacturer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Manufacturer"@en .
