# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#NonSeriousIncident
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#NonSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#NonSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Incident> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#NonSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An incident that did not lead to serious consequences but must be reported for trending analysis."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#NonSeriousIncident> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Non-Serious Incident"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#PassiveDevice
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#PassiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#PassiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Device> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#PassiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A medical device that does not require a source of electrical energy or other power source (e.g., bandages, surgical instruments)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#PassiveDevice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Passive Medical Device"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Probability
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Probability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Probability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Probability level of a risk occurrence (ISO 14971)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Probability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Probability"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Recall
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#CorrectiveAction> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Removal of a device from the market due to safety concerns."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Recall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Recall"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk
