<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A potential hazard associated with the use of a medical device, classified according to IMDRF nomenclature."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#RiskClass
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#RiskClass> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#RiskClass> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Regulatory risk classification for medical devices according to MDR Annex VIII (Classes I, IIa, IIb, III)."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#RiskClass> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Classification"@en .
# 
# http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#SafetyAlert
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#CorrectiveAction> .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A field safety notice (FSN) issued to alert users about a device safety issue without requiring removal."@en .
<http://www.uoc.edu/emdco#SafetyAlert> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Safety Alert"@en .
